{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "autoEstCont 会自动估计污染比例，这是 SoupX 1.6.2 文档明确记载的能力。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "autoEstCont\nAutomatically calculate the contamination fraction"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "该自动估计依赖 soup 中高表达且为某群体标记基因的基因，并在 cluster 层面计算污染比例。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "genes that are highly expressed in the soup and are marker genes for some population can be used to estimate the background contamination. Marker genes are identified using the tfidf method (see quickMarkers). The contamination fraction is then calculated at the cluster level"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的 droplet UMI counts 和 cluster labels 是可用上下文，但仅凭这两项不能确认自动估计所需的 SoupChannel 输入（如 tod/toc 及背景表达）已具备。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:count_matrix",
        "user:clusters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：autoEstCont 的科学假设是通道内存在多种不同细胞类型且具有不同标记基因；在高度同质样本上可能得到警告、错误或极高污染估计，这属于可检测性局限，不代表当前数据一定满足或不满足该条件。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "This function assumes that the channel contains multiple distinct cell types with different marker genes. If you try and run it on a channel with very homogenous cells (e.g. a cell line, flow-sorted cells), you will likely get a warning, an error, and/or an extremely high contamination estimate."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：背景表达谱通常由低 UMI 的空液滴估计，但来源只给出物种混合实验中的示例，未提取全局整数阈值或必需顺序，不能据此认定你的数据已满足背景估计条件。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 7,
          "quote": "To estimate the background expression profile we consider all droplets with <Nemp UMIs, which we assume unambiguously do not contain cells."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": {
    "question": "你当前是否已经构造了 SoupChannel 对象，并提供了 tod（全部液滴计数矩阵）与 toc（仅含细胞的计数矩阵）？",
    "missing_field": "soup_channel_inputs",
    "why_needed": "autoEstCont 需要从 SoupChannel 中获取 soup 背景表达与细胞计数；仅知道存在 droplet UMI counts 和 cluster labels，无法判断 tod/toc 是否已按 SoupX 要求准备，因此无法确认自动估计的输入条件是否满足。"
  }
}
